# A text doubled thirty times is past the longest text: the sum throws a RangeError out of the turn, with no hand-over and no poll on the way. So a turn that may leave by a throw keeps its store: the
# catch reads what the turn in front of the throw stored. Without that test the store is left out and the second line says -1.
